    "created_at": "2017-06-14T17:05:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-14T17:05:12Z",
    "body": "I mean, this is somewhat of a special case as the definition of origin of URL is spread across two specs right now. Over time we should be able to consolidate that into one.\r\n\r\nNot sure about how or whether we can deal with the definition of \"origin\" in general being spread out across HTML/URL/DOM though. I guess I have some ideas but I'll move them to another thread...",
